{"seq":3,"slug":"crispr-genome-editing","title":"博士转化医学 — CRISPR 基因组编辑治疗","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy/crispr-genome-editing","wordCount":1556,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士转化医学-crispr-基因组编辑治疗\">博士转化医学 — CRISPR 基因组编辑治疗</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>CRISPR-Cas9 自 2012 年被改造为可编程核酸酶以来，已从实验室工具演变为获批上市的基因治疗产品。理解其转化路径需要掌握分子机制、递送工程、临床开发与伦理监管四个维度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关键词</th>\n<th>临床代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CRISPR-Cas9 DSB</td>\n<td>sgRNA, PAM, HNH/RuvC</td>\n<td>Casgevy (exa-cel)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碱基编辑 (BE)</td>\n<td>CBE (C→T), ABE (A→G)</td>\n<td>BEAM-101, VERVE-101</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先导编辑 (PE)</td>\n<td>pegRNA, RT 模板, nick</td>\n<td>Prime Medicine 临床前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体外递送</td>\n<td>RNP 电穿孔, CD34⁺ HSC</td>\n<td>exa-cel 自体移植</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体内递送</td>\n<td>LNP-mRNA, AAV</td>\n<td>NTLA-2001 (肝靶向)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Cas9 与 sgRNA 形成 RNP 后扫描基因组，识别 PAM（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext>-NGG-</mtext><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5&#x27;\\text{-NGG-}3&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-NGG-</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）并展开 R-loop。当互补配对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>12</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>nt</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 12\\,\\text{nt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nt</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，HNH 与 RuvC 结构域分别切割互补链与非互补链，产生 DSB。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-dsb-修复路径与编辑结局\">一、DSB 修复路径与编辑结局</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Cas9 产生 DSB] --&gt; B{修复通路选择}&#10;    B --&gt; C[NHEJ 非同源末端连接]&#10;    B --&gt; D[HDR 同源定向修复]&#10;    C --&gt; E[indel → 基因敲除]&#10;    D --&gt; F[模板介导精确替换]\">graph TD\n    A[Cas9 产生 DSB] --&gt; B{修复通路选择}\n    B --&gt; C[NHEJ 非同源末端连接]\n    B --&gt; D[HDR 同源定向修复]\n    C --&gt; E[indel → 基因敲除]\n    D --&gt; F[模板介导精确替换]</pre><p><strong>NHEJ</strong>：不依赖模板，贯穿细胞周期。Ku70/80 识别断端，DNA-PKcs 招募 XRCC4-Ligase IV 连接，常引入 indel 导致移码——Casgevy 敲除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>L</mi><mn>11</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BCL11A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 增强子即基于此。<strong>HDR</strong>：依赖同源模板（ssODN/AAV 供体），仅 S/G2 期活跃，效率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>通路选择比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>HDR</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>HDR</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>donor</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>HDR</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>donor</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>NHEJ</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{\\text{HDR}} = \\frac{k_{\\text{HDR}}[\\text{donor}]}{k_{\\text{HDR}}[\\text{donor}] + k_{\\text{NHEJ}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">HDR</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">HDR</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">donor</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">NHEJ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">HDR</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">donor</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>提高 HDR 的策略：小分子抑制 53BP1、Cas9 nickase、Geminin-Cas9 融合限制 S 期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-碱基编辑器\">二、碱基编辑器</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>融合架构</th>\n<th>转换</th>\n<th>编辑窗口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CBE</td>\n<td>nCas9(D10A)-APOBEC1-UGI</td>\n<td>C·G → T·A</td>\n<td>位置 4-8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ABE</td>\n<td>nCas9(D10A)-TadA*-TadA*</td>\n<td>A·T → G·C</td>\n<td>位置 4-7</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CBE 中 APOBEC1 将 C 脱氨为 U，UGI 阻止 BER 修复，nCas9 切口诱导以 U 为模板修复，实现 C→T。ABE 的 TadA* 将 A 脱氨为 I（读作 G），bystander 编辑率低于 CBE。</p>\n<p>临床：BEAM-101（CBE，靶向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HBG1/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span>，治疗 SCD）进入 I/II 期；VERVE-101（ABE，靶向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PCSK9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span>）展示了剂量依赖的 LDL-C 降低。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-先导编辑器\">三、先导编辑器</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>nCas9(H840A)</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>M-MLV RT</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>pegRNA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PE} = \\text{nCas9(H840A)} + \\text{M-MLV RT} + \\text{pegRNA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nCas9(H840A)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">M-MLV RT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pegRNA</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>pegRNA 包含 spacer（引导结合）、PBS（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>16</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>nt</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{-}16\\,\\text{nt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nt</span></span></span></span></span></span>，退火切口 3&#39; 端）和 RT 模板（编码编辑）。nCas9 仅切 PAM 链，RT 以模板合成含编辑的新链。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>改进</th>\n<th>效率提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PE2</td>\n<td>优化 RT 5 点突变</td>\n<td>~3× PE1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PE3</td>\n<td>加非编辑链 nick</td>\n<td>~3× PE2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PE4/PE5</td>\n<td>MLH1dn 抑制 MMR</td>\n<td>~7× PE2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-递送策略\">四、递送策略</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[递送策略] --&gt; B[体外 Ex Vivo]&#10;    A --&gt; C[体内 In Vivo]&#10;    B --&gt; D[RNP 电穿孔 → HSC 自体移植]&#10;    C --&gt; E[LNP-mRNA → 肝靶向]&#10;    C --&gt; F[AAV → 组织特异血清型]\">graph LR\n    A[递送策略] --&gt; B[体外 Ex Vivo]\n    A --&gt; C[体内 In Vivo]\n    B --&gt; D[RNP 电穿孔 → HSC 自体移植]\n    C --&gt; E[LNP-mRNA → 肝靶向]\n    C --&gt; F[AAV → 组织特异血清型]</pre><p><strong>体外</strong>：分选 CD34⁺ HSC，电穿孔递送 RNP，编辑后经 busulfan 清髓回输。Casgevy 靶向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>L</mi><mn>11</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BCL11A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> +58 增强子，NHEJ 破坏 GATA1 位点，重激活 HbF。RNP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>48</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24\\text{-}48\\,\\text{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span> 内降解，脱靶累积风险低。</p>\n<p><strong>体内</strong>：NTLA-2001 用 LNP 包裹 Cas9 mRNA + TTR sgRNA，ApoE 吸附介导肝摄取。I 期单次给药后 TTR 持续降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>。LNP 关键参数：可电离脂质 pKa <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6.2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>6.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6.2\\text{-}6.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">6.5</span></span></span></span></span>、PEG 脂质 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mol</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5\\text{-}2.5\\,\\text{mol}\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mol</span></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span></span></span></span></span>、N/P 比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\text{-}6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-脱靶分析\">五、脱靶分析</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>灵敏度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GUIDE-seq</td>\n<td>实验无偏（dsODN 标记 DSB）</td>\n<td>~0.1% indel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CIRCLE-seq</td>\n<td>体外无偏（环化 DNA 切割测序）</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DISCOVER-seq</td>\n<td>实验无偏（MRE11 ChIP-seq）</td>\n<td>细胞内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cas-OFFinder</td>\n<td>计算（错配/bulge 比对）</td>\n<td>参数依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>IND 申报要求：(1) ≥1 种无偏实验法 + 计算预测；(2) Top 脱靶位点靶向深度测序（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>100,000</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 100{,}000\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>）；(3) 功能区注释评估致癌风险。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-安全性考量\">六、安全性考量</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>大片段缺失</strong>：DSB 两侧可丢失数 kb，需 long-read 测序（PacBio/ONT）检出。Kosicki et al. (2018) 观察到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kb</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 6\\,\\text{kb}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kb</span></span></span></span></span></span> 缺失。</li>\n<li><strong>染色体碎裂</strong>：多位点编辑可诱发 chromothripsis（Leibowitz et al., 2021）。</li>\n<li><strong>p53 通路激活</strong>：DSB 经 ATM → p53 导致阻滞/凋亡，高编辑效率细胞群富集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mn>53</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP53</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">53</span></span></span></span></span> 缺失突变（Haapaniemi et al., 2018），存在逆向选择风险。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>缓解：碱基/先导编辑避免 DSB、RNP 瞬时递送、高保真 Cas9（eSpCas9, HiFi Cas9）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"七-伦理与监管\">七、伦理与监管</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>体细胞编辑</th>\n<th>生殖系编辑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>遗传性</td>\n<td>不传递后代</td>\n<td>永久进入种系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管</td>\n<td>各国药监常规审评</td>\n<td>多数国家立法禁止临床</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标志事件</td>\n<td>Casgevy 2023 获批</td>\n<td>贺建奎事件 (2018)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>贺建奎事件：未经充分伦理审查即编辑人类胚胎 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CCR5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 基因并植入，暴露嵌合体、脱靶未评估等问题。事后中国修订《生物安全法》禁止未批准生殖系编辑；WHO/NAS 重申仅允许体细胞临床编辑。</p>\n<p>FDA 批准 Casgevy 时要求脱靶全景分析、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 年随访、插入型致癌性评估。EMA 通过 ATMP 路径施加额外环境风险评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>机制辨析</strong>：比较 NHEJ 与 HDR 在细胞周期依赖性、模板需求、产物精确性的差异。精确纠正 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HBB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> E6V 点突变应选哪条通路？瓶颈何在？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>编辑器选型</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PCSK9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 杂合错义突变 (c.381T&gt;A, p.D127E) 需恢复野生型。分析 CBE、ABE、PE 的可行性，考虑 PAM 约束与 bystander 风险。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>递送对比</strong>：体外 RNP 电穿孔 vs 体内 LNP-mRNA 在编辑器暴露时间、免疫原性、靶组织范围的优劣。遗传性肝病与血液病分别适用哪种？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>安全评估</strong>：设计包含无偏实验法 + 计算预测的临床前脱靶流程。为何仅依赖计算预测不够？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>伦理推理</strong>：假设 PE 可在胚胎中以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>99.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;99.9\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.9%</span></span></span></span></span> 精确性纠正 Tay-Sachs 突变且无脱靶，从功利主义、义务论、美德伦理三个框架论证是否应允许生殖系编辑。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Doudna &amp; Charpentier (2014). Science, 346, 1258096. — CRISPR 可编程核酸酶原始论文。</li>\n<li>Anzalone et al. (2019). Nature, 576, 149-157. — 先导编辑奠基论文。</li>\n<li>Frangoul et al. (2021). NEJM, 384(3), 252-260. — Casgevy 临床数据。</li>\n<li>Gillmore et al. (2021). NEJM, 385(6), 493-502. — NTLA-2001 体内编辑里程碑。</li>\n<li>Kosicki et al. (2018). Nat Biotechnol, 36(8), 765-771. — DSB 大片段缺失风险。</li>\n<li>WHO Expert Advisory Committee (2021). — 人类基因组编辑治理框架。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CRISPR 已完成从工具到药物的跨越——Casgevy 标志着体外编辑进入临床常规，NTLA-2001 预示&quot;一次注射、终身治愈&quot;范式。碱基编辑和先导编辑正消除 DSB 安全隐患，将精度推向单碱基水平。转化研究者需在&quot;编辑效率 ↔ 安全性 ↔ 递送可及性&quot;三角中持续优化，严守生殖系编辑伦理红线。下一步聚焦表观基因组编辑（CRISPRa/CRISPRi）与 RNA 编辑（ADAR）的转化前景。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士转化医学 — CRISPR 基因组编辑治疗","id":"博士转化医学-crispr-基因组编辑治疗"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、DSB 修复路径与编辑结局","id":"一-dsb-修复路径与编辑结局"},{"level":3,"text":"二、碱基编辑器","id":"二-碱基编辑器"},{"level":3,"text":"三、先导编辑器","id":"三-先导编辑器"},{"level":3,"text":"四、递送策略","id":"四-递送策略"},{"level":3,"text":"五、脱靶分析","id":"五-脱靶分析"},{"level":3,"text":"六、安全性考量","id":"六-安全性考量"},{"level":3,"text":"七、伦理与监管","id":"七-伦理与监管"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士转化医学 — CAR-T 细胞工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy/car-t-cell-engineering"},"next":null}